1590|30|30|none|(?i)[[:lower:]]: Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; (?i)[[:upper:]]: Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; (?i)[^[:upper:]]: Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; \d: ١ ٣; \D: ١ ٣; \w: ١ ٣ Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; \W: ١ ٣ Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; ^alpha: Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; a[[:digit:]]b: ١ ٣; alnum: ١ ٣ Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; alpha: Ⅻ ⅻ Ⓐ; digit: ١ ٣; graph: SHY; lower: ª ⅻ; print: SHY LSEP; punct: $ + ~ © × € 😀; upper: Ⅻ Ⓐ
